hadiths[169]{hadithnumber,text}:
"824","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey jawanon ki jama'at! Tum mein se jo nikah ki taqat rakhe woh nikah kare, kyunke yeh nigah ko neeche rakhta hai aur sharmgah ko mahfooz rakhta hai; aur jo taqat na rakhe us par roza lazim hai kyunke woh us ke liye rok hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"825","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Allah ki hamd aur sana ki aur farmaya: Lekin main namaz padhta hun aur sota hun, roza rakhta hun aur iftar karta hun, aur aurton se nikah karta hun; to jo meri sunnat se munh mode woh mujh se nahin hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"826","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nikah ka hukm dete aur tajarrud se sakhti se mana farmate, aur farmate: Mohabbat karne wali bachche janne wali se nikah karo; beshak main tum se qayamat ke din nabiyon par kasrat karunga. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ka shahid Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Ibn Hibban ke han bhi Ma'qil bin Yasar ki hadees se hai."
"827","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Aurat se chaar cheezon ke liye nikah kiya jata hai: us ke maal, us ke hasab, us ke husn aur us ke deen ke liye; to deen wali ko hasil karo, tumhare hath khaak aalud hon. Muttafaq alaih baqi Sab'a ke sath."
"828","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab kisi aadmi ko us ke nikah par mubarakbad dete to farmate: Allah tumhen barkat de, tum par barkat kare aur tum donon ko khair mein jama kare. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi, Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"829","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hajat ka tashahhud sikhaya: Tamam hamd Allah ke liye hai, ham Us ki hamd karte hain, Us se madad mangte hain, Us se bakhshish mangte hain, aur apne nafson ke shar se Allah ki panah mangte hain; jise Allah hidayat de use koi gumrah karne wala nahin; aur main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain. Aur teen aayaat padhte. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur Hakim ne ise hasan kaha."
"830","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aurat ko paigham de to agar us mein se woh dekh sake jo use us ke nikah ki targheeb de to kare. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain; aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha. Aur is ka shahid Tirmidhi aur Nasai ke han Mughirah se hai; aur Ibn Majah aur Ibn Hibban ke han Muhammad bin Maslamah ki hadees se hai."
"831","[AI-translation] Aur Muslim ke han Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us aadmi se farmaya jis ne aurat se nikah kiya tha: Kya tum ne use dekha hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur use dekho."
"832","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bheje yahan tak ke pahla mangne wala chhor de ya use ijazat de. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"833","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main apna nafs Aap ko hadiya karti hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki taraf dekha aur nazar uthai aur neeche ki, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sar jhuka liya. Phir jab aurat ne dekha ke Aap ne us ke bare mein kuch faisla na kiya to baith gayi. To Aap ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Agar Aap ko us ki hajat na ho to mujh se us ka nikah kar den. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas kuch hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: Apne ghar walon ke paas jao aur dekho kya kuch pate ho? To woh gaya phir wapas aaya aur kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Main ne kuch na paya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dekho agarche lohe ki anguthi ho. To woh gaya phir wapas aaya aur kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Na lohe ki anguthi, lekin yeh mera tahband hai [Sahl ne kaha: Us ke paas chadar na thi] to us ke liye aadha hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum apne tahband ka kya karoge? Agar tum ne pahna to us par us mein se kuch na hoga, aur agar us ne pahna to tum par kuch na hoga. To woh aadmi baith gaya; aur yahan tak ke jab us ki baithak lambi hui to khada hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use peeth pherte dekha to us ke liye hukm diya aur use bulaya gaya. To jab woh aaya to farmaya: Tumhare paas Quran mein se kya hai? Us ne kaha: Mere paas falan surat aur falan surat hai, ginin. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum unhen zubani padhte ho? Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: Jao, main ne use tumhare paas jo Quran hai us se tumhari milkiyat mein de diya. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai: Jao, main ne tum se us ka nikah kar diya, use Quran sikhao. Aur Bukhari ki ek riwayat mein hai: Ham ne use tumhen jo tumhare paas Quran hai us se de diya. Aur Abu Dawud ke han Abu Hurairah se hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Kya yaad hai? Us ne kaha: Surah Baqarah aur jo us ke baad hai. Aap ne farmaya: Khade ho aur use bees aayaat sikhao."
"834","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amir bin Abdullah bin Zubair apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nikah ka elan karo. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"835","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Burdah bin Abi Musa apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nikah siwae wali ke nahin hota. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Madini, Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur ise mursal hone se ma'lul kaha gaya. Aur Imam Ahmad ne Hasan se Imran bin Husain se marfoo'an riwayat kiya: Nikah siwae wali aur do gawahon ke nahin hota."
"836","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi aurat apne wali ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare us ka nikah batil hai; phir agar us se dakhil ho to us ke liye mahr hai jo us ne us ki sharmgah halal ki; phir agar jhagden to sultan us ka wali hai jis ka wali na ho. Ise Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Abu Awanah, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"837","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bewa ka nikah na kiya jae yahan tak ke us se mashwara liya jae, aur kunwari ka nikah na kiya jae yahan tak ke us se ijazat li jae. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur us ki ijazat kaise? Aap ne farmaya: Ke woh khamosh rahe. Muttafaq alaih."
"838","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shayohar-dekhi apne nafs ki apne wali se ziyada haqdar hai, aur kunwari se mashwara liya jae, aur us ki ijazat khamoshi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur ek lafz mein hai: Wali ke liye shayohar-dekhi ke sath koi hukm nahin hai, aur yateem se mashwara liya jae. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"839","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat aurat ka nikah na karae, aur na aurat apna nikah khud kare. Ise Ibn Majah aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"840","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nafi' se Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne shighar se mana farmaya; aur shighar yeh hai ke aadmi apni beti ka nikah is par kare ke doosra use apni beti ka nikah karae, aur un donon ke darmiyan mahr na ho. Muttafaq alaih; aur donon ne doosri wajh se ittefaq kiya ke shighar ki tafseer Nafi' ke kalaam se hai."
"841","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek kunwari ladki Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur zikr kiya ke us ke walid ne us ka nikah kiya jabke woh napasand karti thi, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use ikhtiyar diya. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur ise mursal hone se ma'lul kaha gaya."
"842","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hasan se Samurah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo bhi aurat ka nikah do waliyon ne kiya woh pehle ke liye hai un donon mein se. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"843","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi ghulam apne maalikon ya ghar walon ki ijazat ke baghair nikah kare woh zinakar hai. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha, aur isi tarah Ibn Hibban ne."
"844","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat aur us ki phuphi ko jama na kiya jae, aur na aurat aur us ki khala ko. Muttafaq alaih."
"845","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Muhrim nikah na kare aur na us ka nikah kiya jae. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai: Aur na paigham bheje. Aur Ibn Hibban ne izafa kiya: Aur na use paigham diya jae."
"846","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah kiya jabke Aap muhrim the. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han Maimunah se hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se nikah kiya jabke Aap halal the."
"847","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sab se haq sharten jinhen poora kiya jae woh hain jin se tum ne sharmgahen halal kin. Muttafaq alaih."
"848","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salamah bin Akwa' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Autas ke saal mut'ah mein teen din ki ruksat di, phir us se mana farmaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"849","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke saal mut'ah se mana farmaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"850","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke din aurton ki mut'ah se aur gharailu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya. Ise Sab'a ne Abu Dawud ke siwa riwayat kiya."
"851","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi' bin Saburah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumhen aurton se faeda uthane ki ijazat di thi, aur beshak Allah ne use qayamat ke din tak haram kar diya hai; to jis ke paas un mein se kuch ho woh use chhor de, aur jo tum ne unhen diya hai us mein se kuch na lo. Ise Muslim, Abu Dawud, Nasai, Ibn Majah, Ahmad aur Ibn Hibban ne riwayat kiya."
"852","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne halala karne wale aur jis ke liye halala kiya jae us par la'nat ki. Ise Ahmad, Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha; aur is bab mein Ali se hai jise Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya."
"853","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kode lagaya hua zinakar siwae apne jaise ke nikah na kare. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"854","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne apni biwi ko teen talaqen din, phir ek aadmi ne us se nikah kiya, phir use dakhil se pahle talaq de di. To us ke shauhar ne us se nikah karna chaha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, yahan tak ke doosra us ke shehad se chakhe jo pahle ne chakha tha. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"855","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Arab ek doosre ke hum-palla hain, aur aazad karda ek doosre ke hum-palla hain, siwae julaha ya hajjam ke. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein ek rawi hai jis ka naam na liya gaya; aur Abu Hatim ne ise munkar kaha. Aur is ka shahid Bazzar ke han Mu'az bin Jabal ki munqati' sanad se hai."
"856","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Usamah se nikah karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"857","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Bani Bayazah! Abu Hind se nikah karo aur use nikah karao. Aur woh hajjam tha. Ise Abu Dawud aur Hakim ne achchi sanad se riwayat kiya."
"858","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Barirah ko us ke shauhar par ikhtiyar diya gaya jab woh aazad huin. Muttafaq alaih ek taweel hadees mein; aur Muslim ke han unhi se hai ke us ka shauhar ghulam tha, aur ek riwayat mein unhi se hai ke woh aazad tha. Aur pehli ziyada sabit hai; aur Ibn Abbas se Bukhari ke han sahih hai ke woh ghulam tha."
"859","[AI-translation] Hazrat Dahhak bin Fairuz Dailami apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main Musalman hua hun jabke mere nikah mein do sagi bahanen hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un donon mein se jise chaho talaq do. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban, Daraqutni aur Baihaqi ne ise sahih kaha; aur Bukhari ne ise ma'lul kaha."
"860","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salim apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Ghailan bin Salamah Musalman hua jabke us ki dus biwiyan thin, to woh us ke sath Musalman huin. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke un mein se chaar chun le. Ise Ahmad aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Bukhari, Abu Zur'ah aur Abu Hatim ne ise ma'lul kaha."
"861","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni beti Zainab ko Abu al-Aas bin Rabi' par chhe saal baad pahle nikah se wapas kiya, aur naya nikah na kiya. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ahmad aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"862","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni beti Zainab ko Abu al-Aas par nae nikah se wapas kiya. Tirmidhi ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ki hadees sanad mein umdah hai, aur amal Amr bin Shu'aib ki hadees par hai."
"863","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat Musalman hui aur us ne nikah kiya; phir us ka shauhar aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main Musalman ho chuka tha aur use mere Islam ki khabar thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use doosre shauhar se le liya aur pahle shauhar ki taraf wapas ki. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya; aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"864","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Ka'b bin Ujrah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Banu Ghifar ki Aliyah se nikah kiya; phir jab woh Aap ke paas aain aur kapde utare to Aap ne un ki kamar mein safedi dekhi. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne kapde pahno aur apne ghar walon se milo. Aur un ke liye mahr ka hukm diya. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein Jamil bin Zaid hai jo majhool hai, aur us ke shaikh mein bahut ikhtilaf hua."
"865","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Jo bhi aadmi aurat se nikah kare aur us se dakhil ho aur use bars wali, deewani ya kodh wali pae to us ke liye us ke milne se mahr hai, aur woh us par hai jis ne use dhoka diya. Ise Sa'id bin Mansur, Malik aur Ibn Abi Shaibah ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain; aur Sa'id ne Ali se bhi isi tarah riwayat kiya aur izafa kiya: Aur us mein qarn ho to us ka shauhar ikhtiyar rakhta hai; phir agar use chhue to us ke liye mahr hai jo us ne us ki sharmgah halal ki."
"866","[AI-translation] Aur Sa'id bin Musayyab ke tareeq se bhi hai ke unhon ne kaha: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne namard ke bare mein faisla kiya ke use ek saal mohlat di jae; aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"867","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mal'oon hai jo aurat ke paas us ki dubur mein aae. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Nasai ke hain; aur is ke rijaal siqah hain, lekin ise mursal hone se ma'lul kaha gaya."
"868","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us aadmi ki taraf nazar nahin karta jo mard ya aurat ke paas us ki dubur mein aae. Ise Tirmidhi, Nasai aur Ibn Hibban ne riwayat kiya, aur ise mauqoof hone se ma'lul kaha gaya."
"869","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho woh apne padosi ko takleef na de; aur aurton ke sath khair ki wasiyat karo, kyunke woh pasli se paida ki gayin hain; aur beshak pasli mein sab se tedha us ka upar hai; to agar tum use seedha karne jao to use tod doge, aur agar chhor do to tedhi rahegi; to aurton ke sath khair ki wasiyat karo. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Muslim ke han hai: Phir agar tum us se faeda uthao to tedh ke sath faeda uthao, aur agar use seedha karne jao to use tod doge, aur us ka todna talaq hai."
"870","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek ghazwe mein the; phir jab ham Madinah pahunche to ham ne dakhil hona chaha. To Aap ne farmaya: Thehro yahan tak ke raat mein dakhil ho, yani shaam ko, taake bikhre balon wali kanghi kare aur ghaib shauhar wali zaed bal saaf kare. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ki ek riwayat mein hai: Jab tum mein se koi ghaibat lambi kare to raat mein apne ghar walon ke paas na aae."
"871","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din Allah ke han martabe mein badtareen log woh mard hai jo apni biwi se milta hai aur woh us se milti hai, phir woh us ka raaz phailata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"872","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Mu'awiyah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham mein se kisi ki biwi ka us par kya haq hai? Aap ne farmaya: Use khilao jab khao, use pehnao jab pahno, chehre par na maro, bura na kaho, aur ghar ke siwa boycott na karo. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya; aur Bukhari ne us ka kuch ta'liqan zikr kiya; aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"873","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Yahud kehte the: Jab aadmi apni biwi ke paas us ki aage se peeche se aae to bachcha bhenga hota hai. To nazil hui: Tumhari aurtain tumhari kheti hain to apni kheti mein jahan se chaho aao [Surah Baqarah: 223]. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"874","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se koi jab apni biwi ke paas aana chahe to kahe: Allah ke naam se; Aey Allah hamen shaitan se door rakh aur shaitan ko us se door rakh jo Tu ne hamen diya hai; kyunke agar un donon ke darmiyan us mein bachcha muqaddar ho to use shaitan kabhi nuqsan nahin dega. Muttafaq alaih."
"875","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apne bistar par bulaye aur woh aane se inkar kare to farishte us par subah tak la'nat karte hain. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Muslim ke han hai: Jo aasman mein hai us se naraz rehta hai yahan tak ke woh us se razi ho jae."
"876","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jodne wali aur judwane wali, godne wali aur gudwane wali par la'nat ki. Muttafaq alaih."
"877","[AI-translation] Hazrat Juzamah bint Wahb (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas logon mein hazir thi jabke Aap farma rahe the: Main ne irada kiya tha ke gheelah se mana karun, phir main ne Room aur Faris ko dekha to woh apne bachchon ko gheelah pilate hain aur woh un ke bachchon ko kuch nuqsan nahin deta. Phir unhon ne Aap se azl ke bare mein poocha? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh chhupa dafan karna hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"878","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri ek bandi hai aur main us se azl karta hun, aur main napasand karta hun ke woh hamla uthae, jabke main chahta hun jo mard chahte hain; aur beshak Yahud kehte hain ke azl chhoti zinda dafan karna hai. Aap ne farmaya: Yahud ne jhoot kaha; agar Allah chahe ke use paida kare to tum use pher na sakoge. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Abu Dawud ke hain, aur Nasai aur Tahawi ne; aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"879","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein azl karte the jabke Quran nazil ho raha tha; aur agar woh koi cheez hoti jis se mana kiya jata to Quran hamen us se mana karta. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai ke yeh Nabiullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahunchi magar Aap ne hamen mana na kiya."
"880","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek ghusl se apni biwiyon ke paas jate the. Dono ne ise riwayat kiya, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"881","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne Safiyyah ko aazad kiya aur un ki aazadi ko un ka mahr banaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"882","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja Aishah se poocha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka mahr kitna tha? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ka apni biwiyon ke liye mahr barah ooqiya aur nash tha. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho nash kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Aadha ooqiya. To yeh paanch sau dirham hue; to yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka apni biwiyon ke liye mahr tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"883","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab Ali ne Fatimah se nikah kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Unhen kuch do. Unhon ne kaha: Mere paas kuch nahin hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari Hutamiyah zirah kahan hai? Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"884","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi aurat mahr, atiyah ya wa'de par nikah kare nikah ki hifazat se pahle to woh us ka hai; aur jo nikah ki hifazat ke baad ho to woh us ka hai jise diya gaya; aur jis par aadmi ko sab se ziyada izzat di jae woh us ki beti ya bahan hai. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya."
"885","[AI-translation] Hazrat Alqamah se Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha gaya jis ne aurat se nikah kiya aur us ke liye mahr muqarrar na kiya, aur us se dakhil se pahle mar gaya. To Ibn Mas'ud ne farmaya: Us ke liye us ki aurton ke mahr jaisa hai, na kami na ziyadti; aur us par iddat hai, aur us ke liye wirasat hai. To Ma'qil bin Sinan Ashja'i khade hue aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Birwa' bint Washiq ke bare mein jo ham mein se ek aurat thin isi tarah faisla kiya jaisa tum ne faisla kiya. To Ibn Mas'ud is se khush hue. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi aur jama'at ne ise sahih kaha."
"886","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aurat ke mahr mein sattu ya khajur de woh halal ho gaya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke mauqoof hone ko tarjeeh di."
"887","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do jootiyon par aurat ke nikah ko jaez rakha. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise sahih kaha, magar is mein ikhtilaf kiya gaya."
"888","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ka aurat se lohe ki anguthi par nikah kiya. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya; aur yeh us taweel hadees ka hissa hai jo nikah ke shuru mein guzar chuki hai."
"889","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mahr dus dirham se kam nahin hota. Ise Daraqutni ne mauqoof riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein kalaam hai."
"890","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen mahr aasan tareen hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"891","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Jaun ki beti Amrah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se panah mangi jab woh Aap ke paas dakhil huin [yani jab Aap ne un se nikah kiya] to Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne panah dene wale se panah mangi hai. Phir Aap ne unhen talaq di aur Usamah ko hukm diya aur unhen teen kapdon se faeda diya. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein matrook rawi hai; aur qisse ki asl Sahih mein Abu Usaid Sa'idi ki hadees se hai."
"892","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abdur Rahman bin Awf par zardi ka nishan dekha aur farmaya: Yeh kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne sone ki guthli ke wazan par aurat se nikah kiya hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhen barkat de, waleema karo agarche bakri se. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"893","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko waleeme ki taraf bulaya jae to us mein aae. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai ko bulaye to jawab de, chaahe shaadi ho ya us jaisa."
"894","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Badtareen khana waleeme ka khana hai: us se roka jata hai jo us mein aata hai, aur us mein bulaya jata hai jo use napasand karta hai; aur jo da'wat qabool na kare us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"895","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko bulaya jae to jawab de; phir agar rozedar ho to dua kare, aur agar iftar kiya ho to khae. Ise Muslim ne bhi riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke han Jabir ki hadees se isi tarah hai. Aur farmaya: Phir agar chahe khae aur agar chahe chhore."
"896","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Waleeme ka khana pahle din haq hai, doosre din ka khana sunnat hai, teesre din ka khana shauhrat hai; aur jo shauhrat kare Allah us se sunayega. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise ghareeb kaha; aur is ke rijaal Sahih ke rijaal hain; aur is ka shahid Ibn Majah ke han Anas se hai."
"897","[AI-translation] Hazrat Safiyyah bint Shaibah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni kisi biwi par jau ke do mudd se waleema kiya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"898","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Khaibar aur Madinah ke darmiyan teen raaten thehre jab Safiyyah se ghar basaya; to main ne Musalmanon ko Aap ke waleeme ki taraf bulaya; to us mein roti aur gosht na tha, aur us mein siwae is ke kuch na tha ke chamde ke dastarkhwan ka hukm diya gaya to bichhaya gaya, phir us par khajur, paneer aur ghee dala gaya. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"899","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab do bulane wale jama hon to darwaze mein qareeb wale ka jawab do; phir agar un mein se ek aage badhe to jo aage badha us ka jawab do. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad za'if hai."
"900","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tek lagakar nahin khata. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"901","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Abi Salamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey ladke! Allah ka naam lo, apne dayan se khao, aur jo tumhare paas hai us se khao. Muttafaq alaih."
"902","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sareed ka pyala laya gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Us ke kinaron se khao, us ke darmiyan se na khao, kyunke barkat us ke darmiyan mein utarti hai. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur yeh alfaz Nasai ke hain, aur is ki sanad sahih hai."
"903","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Baen se na khao kyunke shaitan baen se khata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"904","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi piye to bartan mein saans na le. Muttafaq alaih; aur Abu Dawud ke han Ibn Abbas se isi tarah hai aur izafa kiya: Ya us mein phoonke. Aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"905","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) taqseem farmate aur insaf farmate, aur farmate: Aey Allah! Yeh meri taqseem hai us mein jo main malik hun; to mujhe malamat na farma us mein jo Tu malik hai aur main malik nahin hun. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; lekin Tirmidhi ne is ke mursal hone ko tarjeeh di."
"906","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki do biwiyan hon aur woh un mein se ek ki taraf jhuk jae to qayamat ke din is haal mein aaega ke us ka ek pehlu jhuka hua hoga. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad sahih hai."
"907","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke sunnat mein se hai ke jab aadmi kunwari se nikah kare shayohar-dekhi par to us ke paas saat thehre, phir taqseem kare; aur jab shayohar-dekhi se nikah kare to us ke paas teen thehre, phir taqseem kare. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"908","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab un se nikah kiya to un ke paas teen thehre, aur farmaya: Beshak tum par tumhare ghar walon ke liye zillat nahin hai; agar chaho to tumhare liye saat karun, aur agar tumhare liye saat karun to apni biwiyon ke liye saat karunga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"909","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Saudah bint Zam'ah ne apna din Aishah ko hadiya kiya; aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Aishah ko us ka din aur Saudah ka din taqseem farmate the. Muttafaq alaih."
"910","[AI-translation] Hazrat Urwah se riwayat hai ke Aishah ne kaha: Aey meri bahan ke bete! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas thehrne mein taqseem mein ham mein se kisi ko kisi par fazilat na dete the; aur kam hi din hota magar woh ham sab par guzarte, phir har aurat se baghair chhue qareeb hote, yahan tak ke us tak pahunchte jis ka din hota, phir us ke paas raat guzarte. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Abu Dawud ke hain; aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha. Aur Muslim ke han Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Asr padhte to apni biwiyon par daura farmate, phir un se qareeb hote. Al-hadees."
"911","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne us marz mein jis mein wafat pai poochte: Main kal kahan hun? Murad Aishah ka din tha. To Aap ki biwiyon ne Aap ko ijazat di ke jahan chahen hon; to Aap Aishah ke ghar mein the. Muttafaq alaih."
"912","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab safar ka irada farmate to apni biwiyon ke darmiyan qura dalte; to jin ka teer nikalta unhen lekar nikalte. Muttafaq alaih."
"913","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zam'ah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni biwi ko ghulam ki tarah na mare. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"914","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Sabit bin Qais ki biwi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Sabit bin Qais par mujhe na akhlaq mein aetiraz hai na deen mein, lekin main Islam mein kufr ko napasand karti hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum use us ka bagh wapas karogi? Unhon ne kaha: Han. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bagh qabool karo aur use ek talaq do. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai ke Aap ne use talaq ka hukm diya. Aur Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ke han aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha: Ke Sabit bin Qais ki biwi ne us se khula liya, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki iddat ek haiz muqarrar farmayi. Aur Amr bin Shu'aib ki riwayat mein apne walid se, woh apne dada se Ibn Majah ke han hai ke Sabit bin Qais badsoorat the aur un ki biwi ne kaha: Agar Allah ka khauf na hota jab woh mere paas aate to main un ke chehre par thookti. Aur Ahmad ke han Sahl bin Abi Hasmah ki hadees se hai: Aur yeh Islam mein pahla khula tha."
"915","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke han halal mein sab se napasandeedah talaq hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Abu Hatim ne is ke mursal hone ko tarjeeh di."
"916","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh haiza thin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein. To Umar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha? To Aap ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke us se ruju kare, phir use rakhe yahan tak ke pak ho jae, phir haiz aae, phir pak ho jae; phir agar chahe us ke baad rakhe, aur agar chahe chhune se pahle talaq de; to yahi woh iddat hai jis ka Allah ne hukm diya hai ke aurtain us ke liye talaq di jaen. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai: Use hukm do ke us se ruju kare, phir use pak ya hamla mein talaq de. Aur Bukhari ki doosri riwayat mein hai: Aur us par ek talaq gini gayi. Aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai ke Ibn Umar ne kaha: Lekin tum ne use ek ya do talaqen din to beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe hukm diya ke us se ruju karun, phir use mohlat dun yahan tak ke doosri haiz aae; aur lekin tum ne use teen talaqen din to tum ne apne Rabb ki us mein nafarmani ki jo us ne tumhen tumhari biwi ki talaq ka hukm diya tha. Aur doosri riwayat mein hai ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: To Aap ne use mujh par wapas kiya aur use kuch na samjha, aur farmaya: Jab pak ho jae to talaq de ya rakhe."
"917","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar ki khilafat ke do saal tak teen talaqen ek thin. To Umar bin Khattab ne kaha: Beshak logon ne us mamle mein jaldi ki hai jis mein un ke liye tahammul tha; to agar ham use un par nafiz kar den? To un par nafiz kar diya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"918","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mahmud bin Labid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us aadmi ke bare mein khabar di gayi jis ne apni biwi ko teenon talaqen jama kar din. To Aap gussa hote hue khade hue phir farmaya: Kya Allah Ta'ala ki kitab se khela jata hai jabke main tumhare darmiyan hun? Yahan tak ke ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main use qatl na karun? Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur is ke rawi mawasooq hain."
"919","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Abu Rukanah ne Umm Rukanah ko talaq di. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Apni biwi se ruju karo. To unhon ne kaha: Main ne use teen talaqen din hain. Aap ne farmaya: Main janta hun, ruju karo. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad ke ek lafz mein hai ke Abu Rukanah ne apni biwi ko ek majlis mein teen talaqen din to us par ghamgin hue. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: To woh ek hai. Aur is ki sanad mein Ibn Ishaq hain aur un mein kalaam hai; aur Abu Dawud ne doosri behtar wajh se riwayat kiya hai ke Rukanah ne apni biwi Suhaimah ko pakka talaq diya. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main ne us se siwae ek ka irada nahin kiya tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use un ki taraf wapas kiya."
"920","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jin ka sanjeeda sanjeeda hai aur mazaq sanjeeda hai: Nikah, talaq aur ruju'. Ise Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Ibn Adi ki ek riwayat mein doosri za'if wajh se hai: Talaq, aazad karna aur nikah. Aur Haris bin Abi Usamah ke han Ubadah bin Samit ki hadees se marfoo'an hai: Khel teen mein jaez nahin hai: Talaq, nikah aur aazad karna; to jo unhen kahe woh wajib ho gayin. Aur is ki sanad za'if hai."
"921","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne meri ummat se use mu'af kiya jo un ke nafs baat karen jab tak amal na karen ya bolen nahin. Muttafaq alaih."
"922","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne meri ummat se khata, bhool aur jo un se zabardasti karaya gaya hai utha liya hai. Ise Ibn Majah aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya, aur Abu Hatim ne kaha: Sabit nahin hai."
"923","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab woh apni biwi ko haram kare to kuch nahin hai. Aur kaha: Beshak tumhare liye Rasulullah mein achcha namuna hai [Surah Ahzab: 21]. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Muslim ke han hai: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apne upar haram kare to woh qasam hai jis ka kaffara dega."
"924","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Jaun ki beti jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil huin aur Aap un se qareeb hue to unhon ne kaha: Main tum se Allah ki panah mangti hun. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne azeem se panah mangi hai, apne ghar walon se milo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"925","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Talaq siwae nikah ke baad nahin hai, aur aazad karna siwae milkiyat ke baad nahin hai. Ise Abu Ya'la ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; magar yeh ma'lul hai; aur Ibn Majah ne Miswar bin Makhramah se isi tarah nikala, aur is ki sanad hasan hai, lekin yeh bhi ma'lul hai."
"926","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Adam ke bete ke liye nazr us mein nahin hai jo woh malik na ho, aur us ke liye aazad karna us mein nahin hai jo woh malik na ho, aur us ke liye talaq us mein nahin hai jo woh malik na ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha; aur Bukhari se naql kiya gaya ke yeh is mein sab se sahih hai jo warid hua hai."
"927","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Qalam teen se utha liya gaya hai: sone wale se yahan tak ke jage, bachche se yahan tak ke bada ho, deewane se yahan tak ke aqal kare ya hosh mein aae. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Ibn Hibban ne ise nikala."
"928","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha gaya jo talaq de phir ruju kare aur gawah na banae? To unhon ne kaha: Us ki talaq par aur us ki ruju' par gawah banao. Ise Abu Dawud ne isi tarah mauqoof riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad sahih hai; aur Baihaqi ne ise is lafz se nikala ke Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se us ke bare mein poocha gaya jis ne apni biwi se ruju kiya aur gawah na banae to unhon ne kaha ke ghair sunnat mein hai, ab gawah banao. Aur Tabarani ne ek riwayat mein izafa kiya ke Allah se istighfar karo."
"929","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke jab unhon ne apni biwi ko talaq di to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar se farmaya: Use hukm do ke us se ruju kare. Muttafaq alaih."
"930","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon se eela kiya aur haram kiya; to haram ko halal banaya aur qasam ke liye kaffara muqarrar kiya. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rawi siqah hain."
"931","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab chaar mahine guzar jaen to eela karne wale ko rokha jae yahan tak ke talaq de; aur us par talaq waqe nahin hoti yahan tak ke talaq de. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"932","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai ke main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se pandrah se kuch upar ko paya; woh sab eela karne wale ko rokte the. Ise Shafi'i ne riwayat kiya."
"933","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Jahiliyah ka eela saal aur do saal tha; to Allah ne chaar mahine muqarrar farmaye; phir agar chaar mahine se kam ho to eela nahin hai. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya."
"934","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne apni biwi se zihar kiya, phir us se mil betha. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak main kaffara se pahle us se mil betha hun. Aap ne farmaya: To us se qareeb na ho yahan tak ke woh kare jo Allah ne tumhen hukm diya hai. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha; aur Nasai ne is ke mursal hone ko tarjeeh di. Aur Bazzar ne ise doosri wajh se Ibn Abbas se riwayat kiya aur us mein izafa kiya: Kaffara do aur dobara na karo."
"935","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salamah bin Sakhr se riwayat hai ke Ramazan dakhil hua to mujhe khauf hua ke main apni biwi se mil bethun; to main ne us se zihar kiya. Phir mujh par ek raat us mein se kuch zahir ho gaya aur main us se mil betha. To mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gardan aazad karo. Main ne kaha: Main siwae apni gardan ke malik nahin hun. Aap ne farmaya: To do mahine musalsal roze rakho. Main ne kaha: Aur mujhe jo pahunchi hai woh siwae roze se kyun pahunchi hai? Aap ne farmaya: Saath miskeenon ke darmiyan khajur ka tokra khilao. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Jarud ne ise sahih kaha."
"936","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke falan ne poocha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Batayen agar ham mein se koi apni biwi ko fahisha par pae to kya kare? Agar bole to badi baat bole, aur agar khamosh rahe to isi jaisi par khamosh rahe! To Aap ne use jawab na diya; phir jab us ke baad hua to woh Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak jis ke bare mein main ne Aap se poocha tha us mein mubtala ho gaya hun. To Allah ne Surah Noor mein aayaat nazil kin aur Aap ne unhen us par padha aur nasihat ki aur yaad dilaya, aur use khabar di ke duniya ka azab aakhirat ke azab se halka hai. Us ne kaha: Nahin, us ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke sath bheja, main ne us par jhoot nahin kaha. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use bulaya aur use bhi nasihat ki. Us ne kaha: Nahin, us ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke sath bheja, beshak woh jhoota hai. To Aap ne mard se shuru kiya aur chaar gawahiyan din, phir aurat se dohraen, phir un donon ke darmiyan judai ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"937","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se bhi riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne li'an karne walon se farmaya: Tum donon ka hisab Allah Ta'ala par hai; tum mein se ek jhoota hai; tumhen us par koi raasta nahin hai. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mera maal? Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum ne us par sach kaha hai to woh us se hai jo tum ne us ki sharmgah halal ki; aur agar tum ne us par jhoot kaha hai to woh tumhen us se door karta hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"938","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use dekho; phir agar woh use gore seedhe balon wala lae to woh us ke shauhar ka hai, aur agar use surmadani kale ghungrale balon wala lae to woh hai jis ne use us se mansoob kiya. Muttafaq alaih."
"939","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko hukm diya ke panchwin par apna hath munh par rakhe, aur farmaya: Beshak yeh wajib karne wali hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain."
"940","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd se li'an karne walon ke qisse mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Phir jab donon apne li'an se farigh hue to unhon ne kaha: Main ne us par jhoot kaha hai Ya Rasulullah! Agar main use rokun. To us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se pahle use teen talaqen din. Muttafaq alaih."
"941","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Meri biwi chhune wale ka hath nahin rokti hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use door kar do. Us ne kaha: Mujhe khauf hai ke mera nafs us ke peeche jae. Aap ne farmaya: To us se faeda uthao. Ise Abu Dawud aur Bazzar ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain; aur Nasai ne ise doosri wajh se Ibn Abbas se is lafz se nikala: Unhon ne kaha: Use talaq do. Us ne kaha: Main us se sabr nahin kar sakta. Aap ne farmaya: To use rakho."
"942","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna jab li'an karne walon ki aayat nazil hui: Jo bhi aurat qaum mein use dakhil kare jo un mein se nahin hai to woh Allah ke han kisi cheez mein nahin hai, aur Allah use apni jannat mein dakhil na karega; aur jo bhi aadmi apne bachche ka inkar kare jabke woh use dekh raha ho to Allah us se parda karega aur use agle pichhle makhlooq ke sarbarahon par ruswa karega. Ise Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"943","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jo aankh ke palak jhapakne bachche ka iqrar kare us ke liye use nafi karna nahin hai. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya, aur yeh hasan mauqoof hai."
"944","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri biwi ne kala ladka jana hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas unt hain? Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: Un ke rang kya hain? Us ne kaha: Surkh. Aap ne farmaya: Kya un mein khaki hai? Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: To yeh kahan se? Us ne kaha: Shayad use nasl ne kheecha hai. Aap ne farmaya: To shayad tumhare is bete ko nasl ne kheecha hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai ke woh use nafi karne ka ishara kar raha tha; aur aakhir mein farmaya: Aur use us se nafi ki ruksat na di."
"945","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miswar bin Makhramah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Subai'ah Aslamiyah (Raziyallahu anha) ne apne shauhar ki wafat ke chand raaton baad bacha jana. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur Aap se nikah ki ijazat mangi. To Aap ne unhen ijazat di aur unhon ne nikah kiya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya aur is ki asl Sahihain mein hai; aur ek lafz mein hai ke unhon ne apne shauhar ki wafat ke chalis raaton baad waza' kiya. Aur Muslim ke ek lafz mein hai ke Zuhri ne kaha: Aur main harj nahin samajhta ke woh khoon mein nikah kare, magar us ka shauhar pak hone tak us se qareeb na ho."
"946","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Barirah ko hukm diya gaya ke teen haiz se iddat guzare. Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rawi siqah hain, lekin yeh ma'lul hai."
"947","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sha'bi se Fatimah bint Qais se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se teen talaq wali ke bare mein riwayat hai ke us ke liye na rehaish hai na kharch. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"948","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi aurat maiyyat par teen se upar sog na kare siwae shauhar par chaar mahine dus din; aur range kapda na pahne siwae asb ke kapde ke; aur surma na lagae, khushbu na lagae, siwae is ke ke pak hone par qist ya azfar ka thoda le. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur Abu Dawud aur Nasai ke han izafe se hai: Aur mehndi na lagae. Aur Nasai ke han hai: Aur kanghi na kare."
"949","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne Abu Salamah ki wafat ke baad apni aankh par musabbar rakha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak yeh chehra jawan karta hai; to use siwae raat ke na lagao, aur din mein utar do; aur khushbu aur mehndi se kanghi na karo kyunke yeh khizab hai. Main ne kaha: Kis cheez se kanghi karun? Aap ne farmaya: Beri se. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad hasan hai."
"950","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Meri beti ka shauhar mar gaya hai aur us ki aankh dukhne lagi hai, kya ham use surma lagayen? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Muttafaq alaih."
"951","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke meri khala ko talaq di gayi to us ne apni khajur katne ka irada kiya; to ek aadmi ne use nikalne se jhidka. To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain. To Aap ne farmaya: Balke apni khajur kato, kyunke shayad tum sadqa karo ya neki karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"952","[AI-translation] Hazrat Furaiah bint Malik se riwayat hai ke un ka shauhar apne ghulamon ki talash mein nikla to unhon ne use qatl kar diya. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha ke main apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas jaun kyunke mere shauhar ne mere liye na milkiyat wala makan chhoda na kharch. To Aap ne farmaya: Han. Phir jab main hujre mein thi to mujhe pukara aur farmaya: Apne ghar mein thehro yahan tak ke kitab apni muddat ko pahunche. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne us mein chaar mahine dus din iddat guzari. Unhon ne kaha: To us ke baad Usman ne is se faisla kiya. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi, Zuhli, Ibn Hibban, Hakim aur ghair ne ise sahih kaha."
"953","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fatimah bint Qais se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mere shauhar ne mujhe teen talaqen din hain, aur mujhe khauf hai ke mujh par chadhai ki jae. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne unhen hukm diya aur woh muntaqil huin. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"954","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Aas se riwayat hai ke hamari Nabi ki sunnat par ghul-mul na karo; aulad wali bandi ki iddat jab us ka sardar mar jae chaar mahine dus din hai. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Daraqutni ne ise inqita se ma'lul kaha."
"955","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aqra siwae tuhr ke nahin hain. Ise Malik ne ek qisse mein sahih sanad se nikala."
"956","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke bandi ki talaq do talaqen hain aur us ki iddat do haiz hain. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya; aur ise marfoo'an nikala aur ise za'if kaha. Aur ise Abu Dawud, Tirmidhi aur Ibn Majah ne Aishah ki hadees se nikala, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; magar unhon ne mukhalifat ki aur is ke za'f par ittefaq kiya."
"957","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ruwaifi' bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Us aadmi ke liye halal nahin hai jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta ho ke apna pani ghair ki kheti ko pilae. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha, aur Bazzar ne ise hasan kaha."
"958","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se gumshuda ki biwi ke bare mein riwayat hai ke woh chaar saal intezar kare, phir chaar mahine dus din iddat guzare. Ise Malik aur Shafi'i ne riwayat kiya."
"959","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gumshuda ki biwi us ki biwi hai yahan tak ke us ke paas wazahat aae. Ise Daraqutni ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"960","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi aadmi aurat ke paas raat na guzare siwae is ke ke woh nikah karne wala ho ya mahram ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"961","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Koi aadmi aurat se tanhai na kare siwae mahram ke sath. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"962","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Autas ki qaidiyon ke bare mein farmaya: Hamla wali se humbistari na ki jae yahan tak ke jan de, aur ghair hamla wali se yahan tak ke ek haiz aae. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ka shahid Ibn Abbas se Daraqutni mein hai."
"963","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Bachcha bistar ka hai aur zinakar ke liye pathar hai. Ise un ki hadees se Muttafaq alaih riwayat kiya gaya; aur Aishah ki hadees se ek qisse mein; aur Ibn Mas'ud se Nasai ke han; aur Usman se Abu Dawud ke han."
"964","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek chuski aur do chuskiyan haram nahin kartin. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"965","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dekho tumhare bhai kaun hain, kyunke doodh bhook se hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"966","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Sahlah bint Suhail aain aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Salim Abu Huzaifah ka aazad karda hamare sath hamare ghar mein hai, aur woh baligh ho chuka hai jo mard baligh hote hain. Aap ne farmaya: Use doodh pilao, tum us par haram ho jaogi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"967","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Aflah jo Abu Qu'ais ka bhai hai hijab ke baad un ke paas ijazat mangne aaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne use ijazat dene se inkar kiya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae to main ne Aap ko khabar di jo main ne kiya tha. To Aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke use mere paas ijazat dun. Aur farmaya: Beshak woh tumhara chacha hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"968","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Quran mein jo nazil hua us mein tha: Dus ma'loom chuskiyan haram karti hain; phir paanch ma'loom se mansookh huin. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat pa gae jabke woh Quran mein padhi jane wali mein thin. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"969","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Hamzah ki beti ke bare mein kaha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Woh mere liye halal nahin hai; beshak woh doodh se mere bhai ki beti hai, aur doodh se haram hota hai jo nasab se haram hota hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"970","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Doodh se siwae us ke haram nahin hota jo anton ko khole aur doodh chhudane se pahle ho. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur unhon ne aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"971","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke doodh siwae do saal mein nahin hai. Ise Daraqutni aur Ibn Adi ne marfoo'an aur mauqoofan riwayat kiya, aur donon ne mauqoof ko tarjeeh di."
"972","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Doodh siwae us ke nahin hai jo haddi ko mazboot kare aur gosht ugaye. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"973","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Haris se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umm Yahya bint Abi Ihab se nikah kiya; to ek aurat aai aur kaha: Main ne tum donon ko doodh pilaya hai. To unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaise jab kaha gaya hai? To Uqbah ne us se judai ki aur us ne ghair shauhar se nikah kiya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"974","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ziyad Sahmi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke bewaqoof aurat se doodh pilwaya jae. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya magar yeh mursal hai, aur Ziyad ki suhbat nahin hai."
"975","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Hind bint Utbah jo Abu Sufyan ki biwi thin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Abu Sufyan kanjoos aadmi hai jo mujhe kharch mein se woh nahin deta jo mujhe aur mere beton ko kafi ho siwae is ke jo main us ke maal se us ki be-khabri mein lun; to kya mujh par is mein gunah hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Us ke maal se ma'roof se lo jo tumhen aur tumhare beton ko kafi ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"976","[AI-translation] Hazrat Tariq Muharibi se riwayat hai ke ham Madinah aae to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba dete khade the aur farma rahe the: Dene wale ka hath upar hai; aur us se shuru karo jis ka kharch tum uthate ho: apni walidah aur walid, apni bahan aur bhai, phir qareeb tar qareeb tar. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Daraqutni ne ise sahih kaha."
"977","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghulam ke liye us ka khana aur kapda hai, aur use kaam mein siwae us ke takleef na di jae jitna woh taqat rakhe. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"978","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Mu'awiyah Qushairi apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham mein se kisi ki biwi ka us par kya haq hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ke tum use khilao jab khao, use pehnao jab pahno, chehre par na maro, bura na kaho... Al-hadees. Aur yeh aurton se husn sulook mein guzar chuki hai."
"979","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hajj ki taweel hadees mein riwayat hai ke Aap ne aurton ke zikr mein farmaya: Aur un ke liye tum par ma'roof se un ka rizq aur kapda hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"980","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ke gunah ke liye kafi hai ke use zaya kare jis ka rizq woh uthata hai. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya; aur yeh Muslim ke han is lafz se hai: Ke us se roke jis ke rizq ka woh malik hai."
"981","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se marfoo'an hamla wali ke bare mein riwayat hai jis ka shauhar mar gaya ho ke Aap ne farmaya: Us ke liye kharch nahin hai. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya, aur is ke rijaal siqah hain, lekin unhon ne kaha: Mahfooz is ka mauqoof hona hai. Aur kharch ki nafi Fatimah bint Qais ki hadees mein sabit hai jaise guzar chuki hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"982","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai, aur tum mein se koi us se shuru kare jis ka kharch woh uthata hai. Aurat kehti hai: Mujhe khilao ya talaq do. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad hasan hai."
"983","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Musayyab se us aadmi ke bare mein riwayat hai jo apne ghar walon par kharch na pae ke unhon ne kaha: Un donon ke darmiyan judai ki jae. Ise Sa'id bin Mansur ne Sufyan se, woh Abu Zinad se, woh un se riwayat kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne Sa'id bin Musayyab se kaha: Sunnat hai? To unhon ne kaha: Sunnat hai. Aur yeh qawi mursal hai."
"984","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne lashkaron ke ameeron ko un aadmiyon ke bare mein likha jo apni biwiyon se ghaib the ke unhen kharch ya talaq par majboor karen; phir agar talaq den to jitna unhon ne roka us ke kharch se bhejen. Ise Shafi'i ne riwayat kiya; phir Baihaqi ne hasan sanad se."
"985","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere paas dinar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Use apne nafs par kharch karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai? Aap ne farmaya: Use apne bete par kharch karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai? Aap ne farmaya: Use apne ghar walon par kharch karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use apne khadim par kharch karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ziyada janne wale ho. Ise Shafi'i ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz unhi ke hain, aur Abu Dawud ne; aur Nasai aur Hakim ne ise biwi ko bete par muqaddam karke nikala."
"986","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bahz bin Hakim apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main kis se neki karun? Aap ne farmaya: Apni walidah se. Main ne kaha: Phir kis se? Aap ne farmaya: Apni walidah se. Main ne kaha: Phir kis se? Aap ne farmaya: Apni walidah se. Main ne kaha: Phir kis se? Aap ne farmaya: Apne walid se, phir qareeb tar qareeb tar se. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"987","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mera yeh beta mera pet us ke liye bartan tha, mera than us ke liye mashkeeza tha, meri god us ke liye panah thi; aur beshak us ke walid ne mujhe talaq di hai aur woh use mujh se cheenna chahta hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum us ki ziyada haqdar ho jab tak nikah na karo. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"988","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mera shauhar mere bete ko le jana chahta hai jabke us ne mujhe nafa diya hai aur mujhe Abu Inabah ke kunwen se pilaya hai. To us ka shauhar aaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey ladke! Yeh tumhara walid hai aur yeh tumhari walidah hai; to un donon mein se jis ka chaho hath pakad lo. To us ne apni walidah ka hath pakda aur woh use lekar chali gayi. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"989","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Sinan se riwayat hai ke woh Musalman hue magar un ki biwi ne Musalman hone se inkar kiya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne walidah ko ek taraf bithaya, walid ko ek taraf, aur bachche ko un donon ke darmiyan bithaya. To woh apni walidah ki taraf jhuka. To Aap ne farmaya: Aey Allah use hidayat de. To woh apne walid ki taraf jhuka aur us ne use le liya. Ise Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"990","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hamzah ki beti ka faisla us ki khala ke haq mein kiya, aur farmaya: Khala walidah ke darje mein hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad ne ise Ali ki hadees se nikala aur farmaya: Aur ladki us ki khala ke paas hai, kyunke khala walidah hai."
"991","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ke paas us ka khadim us ka khana lae to agar use apne sath na bithae to use ek ya do luqme de. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"992","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Ek aurat ko billi mein azab diya gaya jis use qaid kiya yahan tak ke woh mar gayi; to woh us mein aag mein dakhil hui; na us ne use khilaya aur pilaya jab use qaid kiya, aur na use chhoda ke zameen ke keede khae. Muttafaq alaih."
